# Sword of the Meek: "Whenever a 1/1 creature you control enters". An Ornithopter (0/2) entering on turn 3 is not 1/1, so nothing is asked
# (! Bot1.Accept) and the Sword stays in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Sword of the Meek
Disenchant
Ornithopter
Forest x9

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sword of the Meek.Cast
